---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Ask for a field: "lisbon booking ref", "dell receipt 2025". Falls back to `mxr ask` over all mail only when no record matches

Usage: mxr records ask [OPTIONS] <QUERY>

Arguments:
  <QUERY>

Options:
      --no-fallback        Don't fall back to `mxr ask` when no record matches
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
